[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9840.63, "timestamp": "02:44:00", "text": "与所有人建立联系"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9844.389, "timestamp": "02:44:04", "text": "就像那样，是的，更像是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9847.59, "timestamp": "02:44:07", "text": "下个月之后，我们将开启新的篇章。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9850.389, "timestamp": "02:44:10", "text": "我心想，“好吧，我去做吧。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9853.83, "timestamp": "02:44:13", "text": "只是为了小丑那件事，仅此而已"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9857.269, "timestamp": "02:44:17", "text": "是的。不仅仅是为了好玩而已。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9860.23, "timestamp": "02:44:20", "text": "为了模型，但仍然这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9862.309, "timestamp": "02:44:22", "text": "我自己玩得很开心。就是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9864.07, "timestamp": "02:44:24", "text": "事情。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9865.67, "timestamp": "02:44:25", "text": "是的。因为就像，不，我的想法是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9867.429, "timestamp": "02:44:27", "text": "你真的喜欢和每个人建立联系"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9868.95, "timestamp": "02:44:28", "text": "你喜欢的人，你知道你思念的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9871.429, "timestamp": "02:44:31", "text": "花了这么多时间聊天或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9872.99, "timestamp": "02:44:32", "text": "就像你知道的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9875.269, "timestamp": "02:44:35", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9876.79, "timestamp": "02:44:36", "text": "是啊，我感觉就像看到了每一个新的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9879.95, "timestamp": "02:44:39", "text": "每天都有客人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9883.83, "timestamp": "02:44:43", "text": "是的，现在，而且从现在开始就是了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9885.63, "timestamp": "02:44:45", "text": "比如……一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9889.03, "timestamp": "02:44:49", "text": "人们呃，就像每个人都喜欢一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9891.269, "timestamp": "02:44:51", "text": "晚上这个时候大概就是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9894.87, "timestamp": "02:44:54", "text": "比如从6点到10点、11点、12点。所以很难……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9896.95, "timestamp": "02:44:56", "text": "把所有人都叫来。如果我从"}]